#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "Izvještaji"

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Known Issues"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Recent updates to this chapter bring it up to date as far as actually "
"selecting, configuring, viewing, exporting, and saving reports. However, "
"there are known issues with the content of some reports which will be "
"addressed in more detail in a future update, both of &kmymoney; itself as "
"well as this Handbook. These are listed below for your information, and to "
"avoid surprises and unnecessary bug reports."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In some Investment Reports, questions have been raised regarding the methods "
"used in the calculations related to capital gains, especially unrealized "
"gains or losses (the difference in value of currently held securities "
"compared to their original purchase cost.) This is particularly true when "
"the period of the report does not extend prior to the purchase and after the "
"sale of any security."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In reports involving a data pivot (where columns represent time periods) if "
"currency conversions are involved, the conversions may not be applied on the "
"same dates when transactions are not grouped by dates. This can lead to "
"different values in different reports, where the values might be expected to "
"be the same."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifying closed accounts for inclusion in reports does not always work as "
"expected. Due to interactions between different parts of the report "
"configuration and generation, it is not always possible to include data from "
"accounts which are now closed, but which were open during the specified time "
"frame of the report."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Available Reports"
msgstr "Dostupni Izvještaji"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-reports.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Reports View</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pregled Izvještaja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-reports.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Reports View</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pregled Izvještaja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Reports View lists all available reports, grouped under the following "
"headings."
msgstr ""
"Pregled izvještaja izlistava sve dostupne izvještaje, grupisane u sljedećim "
"zaglavljima."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Income and Expenses"
msgstr "Prihodi i troškovi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:83
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The reports in this section show your income and expenses either for the "
#| "current month or for each month in the current year. Of course, the "
#| "duration of the overall report and the duration captured by each column "
#| "can be configured to your liking. Graphs and Pie Charts also may be "
#| "produced."
msgid ""
"These reports show your income and expenses for the current month or for "
"each month in the current year. Of course, the duration of the overall "
"report and the duration captured by each column can be configured to your "
"liking. Graphs and Pie Charts also may be produced."
msgstr ""
"Izvještaji u ovom odjelu prikazuju prihode i troškove za tekući mjesec ili "
"za svaki mjesec tekuće godine. Naravno, dužina cjelokupnog izvještaja i "
"dužina svake kolone može biti podešena kako vam odgovara. Grafovi i kružni "
"grafovi također mogu biti prikazani."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Net Worth"
msgstr "Neto vrijednost"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:93
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Here there are reports that describe your net worth, either at the "
#| "current moment, every month for the current year, or every year of your "
#| "history. In addition, there is a 7-day Cash Flow Forecast and a Net Worth "
#| "Graph. There are also reports to get the balances for all of your "
#| "accounts at any given point in time."
msgid ""
"These reports describe your net worth, either at the current moment, every "
"month for the current year, or every year of your history. In addition, "
"there is a 7-day Cash Flow Forecast and a Net Worth Graph. There are also "
"reports to get the balances for all of your accounts at any given point in "
"time. As with the Income and Expenses Reports, time periods and groupings "
"can be configured as desired."
msgstr ""
"Tu se nalaze izvještaji koji opisuju vašu neto vrijednost, za tekući mjesec, "
"za svaki mjesec tekuće godine, ili za svaku godinu u vašoj historiji. "
"Dodatno, tu su i sedmodnevna prognoza protoka gotovine i grafik neto "
"vrijednosti. Također, tu su i izvještaji stanja svih vaših računa u bilo "
"kojem trenutku."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transactions"
msgstr "Transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:105
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This section includes reports that list individual transactions. This is "
#| "the best way to print your account register for a specific period of "
#| "time. The transactions printed can be grouped together according to your "
#| "liking by choosing the appropriate report, such as:"
msgid ""
"These reports list individual transactions. This is the best way to print "
"your account register for a specific period of time. The transactions "
"included in a report can be grouped together according to your liking by "
"choosing the appropriate report, such as: <itemizedlist> <listitem><para>By "
"Account</para></listitem> <listitem><para>By Category</para></listitem> "
"<listitem><para>By Month or Week</para></listitem> <listitem><para>By Payee</"
"para></listitem> </itemizedlist> You can also choose the time period for the "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dio uključuje izvještaje koji izlistavaju pojedinačne transakcije. Ovo "
"je najbolji način za printanje registra vašeg računa za određeni vremenski "
"period. Transakcije koje se printaju mogu biti grupisane po vašoj želji "
"biranjem odgovarajućeg izvještaja, kao što su:"

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cash Flow"
msgstr "Protok gotovine"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:122
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Cash Flow report is similar to a Transaction report, but it displays "
#| "all cash-flow related transactions."
msgid ""
"The Cash Flow Report is similar to a Transaction Report, but it displays all "
"cash-flow related transactions."
msgstr ""
"Izvještaj protoka gotovine je sličan transakcijskom izvještaju, ali "
"prikazuje sve transakcije vezane za protok gotovine."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investments"
msgstr "Ulaganja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These reports help you keep track of your investments. They only include "
"investment accounts. There are a variety of presentation filters and styles, "
"as shown in this partial list."
msgstr ""
"Ovi izještaji vam pomažu da pratite vaša ulaganja. Oni uključuju "
"investicione račune. Postoje razni načini i stilovi prezentovanja, koji su "
"prikazani u ovoj parcijalnoj listi."

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:136
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Investment Transactions: Similar to a Transactions report, and includes "
#| "the share price and quantities."
msgid ""
"Investment Transactions: Similar to a Transactions Report, and includes the "
"share price and quantities."
msgstr ""
"Investicione transakcije: slične transakcijskom izvještaju, uključuju cijenu "
"dionica i količine."

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Investment Holdings by Account: Shows the current shares, price, and value "
"for each account."
msgstr ""
"Posjed investicija po računu: pokazuje trenutne dionici, cijenu, i "
"vrijednost za svaki račun."

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:140
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Investment Holdings by Type: Same as the previous report, but organizes "
#| "the accounts by type (Stock, Mutual Fund, etc)"
msgid ""
"Investment Holdings by Type: Same as the previous report, but organizes the "
"accounts by type (Stock, Mutual Fund, &etc;)"
msgstr ""
"Posjed investicija po tipu: isto kao i prethodni izvještaj, ali organizira "
"račune po tipu (dionice, zajednički fond, itd)"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Investment Performance by Account: Shows the annualized performance over any "
"period of time. This performs a cash flow analysis of all money coming into "
"and going out of the account. As a result, this is a very accurate picture "
"of how well your investments are doing."
msgstr ""
"Performanse investicija po računu: pokazuje performanse tokom bilo kojeg "
"perioda. Izvršava analizu protoka gotovine koja dolazi i odlazi sa računa. "
"Kao rezultat, ovo je vrlo dostojan prikaz toga koliko dobro vam investicije "
"funkcionišu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:147
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Investment Performance by Type: Same as the previous report, but "
#| "organizes the accounts by type (Stock, Mutual Fund, etc)"
msgid ""
"Investment Performance by Type: Same as the previous report, but organizes "
"the accounts by type (Stock, Mutual Fund, &etc;)"
msgstr ""
"Performanse investicija po tipu: Isto kao prethodni izvještaj, ali "
"organizira račune po tipu (dionice, zajednički fond, itd)"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are also graphs for Investment Prices and Investment Worth."
msgstr ""
"Također, tu su grafovi za cijene investicija i vrijednosti investicija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr "Porezi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:159
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The tax reports are just like the transactions reports, with the addition "
#| "that only Tax related categories are included. This allows you to flag "
#| "certain categories as being tax-related, and then get one big report at "
#| "the end of the year to see them all in one place. They may be listed "
#| "either by Category or by Payee, and for the last fiscal year."
msgid ""
"The Tax Reports are just like the Transactions Reports, but only Tax related "
"categories are included. This allows you to flag certain categories as being "
"tax-related, and then get one big report at the end of the year to see them "
"all in one place. They may be listed either by Category or by Payee, and for "
"the last fiscal year."
msgstr ""
"Porezni izvještaji su isti kao i transakcijski izvještaji, sa dodatkom da su "
"uključene samo kategorije vezane za porez. Ovo vam omogućava da označite "
"pojedine kategorije kao vezane za porez, i onda dobijete jedan veliki "
"izvještaj na kraju godine na kojem se vide sve na jednom mjestu. Mogu biti "
"izlistane po kategoriji ili po primaocu uplate, i za posljednju fiskalnu "
"godinu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Budgeting"
msgstr "Određivanje budžeta"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:170
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The budgeting reports are similar to net worth reports, but the reports "
#| "can display the budget for a given year, or even compare it to the actual "
#| "income and expenses for the same period."
msgid ""
"These reports are similar to the Net Worth Reports, but they can display the "
"budget for a given year, and can compare it to the actual income and "
"expenses for the same period."
msgstr ""
"Budžetni izvještaji su slični izvještajima o neto vrijednosti, ali mogu "
"prikazati budžet za bilo koju godinu, ili čak uporediti ga sa stvarnim "
"prihodima i troškovima za isti period."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forecast"
msgstr "Prognoza"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:179
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The forecast reports are just like the net worth reports, but they use "
#| "the information to display forecast information. You can display the "
#| "information at various levels and for the time frame of your choosing."
msgid ""
"These reports are just like the Net Worth Reports, but they use the "
"information to display forecast information. You can display the information "
"at various levels and for the time frame of your choosing."
msgstr ""
"Izvještaji o prognozi su isti kao izvještaji o neto vrijednosti, ali oni "
"koriste informacije da prikažu informacije o prognozi. Možete prikazati "
"informacije na raznim nivoima i za vremenski okvir po vašem izboru."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Informacija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These reports display non-transaction information about schedules, accounts, "
"and loans."
msgstr ""
"Ovi izvještaji prikazuju informacije koje nisu vezane za transakcije o "
"rasporedima, računima i kreditima."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Charts"
msgstr "Dijagrami"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If <link linkend=\"details.reports.charts\">Charts</link> are enabled, this "
"section lists all the reports which are marked to display a graphical chart "
"as the default. They are also listed in one of the other sections, but they "
"are also aggregated here for your easy reference."
msgstr ""
"Ako su <link linkend=\"details.reports.charts\">Dijagrami</link> uključeni, "
"ovaj dio izlistava sve izvještaje koji su unaprijed označeni  za prikaz "
"grafičkih dijagrama. Također su izlistani u jednom od ostalih dijelova, ali "
"su takođe zadržani ovdje da biste se lakše orijentisali."

#. Tag: title
#: details-reports.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "Favorite Reports"
msgstr "Omiljeni izvještaji"

#. Tag: para
#: details-reports.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section lists all the reports you have marked as a favorite in the "
"report configuration dialog. They are still listed in one of the other "
"sections, but they are also aggregated here for your easy reference. "
"Favorite reports are also included on the financial summary page for even "
"easier reference."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dio izlistava sve izvještaje koje ste označili kao omiljene u dijalogu "
"za konfiguraciju izvještaja. Izlistani su u jednom od ostalih dijelova, ali "
"su zadržani ovdje da biste se lakše orijentisali. Omiljeni izvještaji su "
"također uključeni na stranici finansijskog zaključka za još lakšu "
"orijentaciju."

